shotId`, and any toggle flags. Extract these to the parent workspace component in the same refactor pass to avoid runtime failures.\\n- **`useBuilderStore.getState()` for Stable Method References**: When a hook needs to expose a store action without triggering re-renders on every state change, use `useBuilderStore.getState().methodName` in the return object (e.g., `syncProjectStructure: useBuilderStore.getState().syncProjectStructure`). This gives a stable reference to the Zustand action without subscribing the hook to the store's reactive state.\\n- **`containerRef` Typing for Fullscreen**: When using `containerRef` for `requestFullscreen()`, type it as `React.RefObject<HTMLDivElement>` (not `RefObject<HTMLDivElement | null>`). The `null` union causes type assignment errors when passed to `LegacyRef<HTMLElement>` props in Radix/React component APIs.\"}", "tool_call_id": "toolu_vrtx_01YRwzWvdyjy7QJVTDwjuWkc", "id": null, "provider_name": null, "provider_details": null, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
